    "details": {
      "cr": 0.25,
      "type": {
        "value": "custom",
        "subtype": "",
        "custom": "Pokémon"
      },
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Flor. Não importa o que esteja fazendo, se perceber qualquer movimento por perto, Bellsprout reage imediatamente estendendo suas vinhas finas. Ele enterra os pés profundamente no solo para se hidratar, mas não consegue fugir caso seja atacado enquanto faz isso.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 1/4 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Grama &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 50% M / 50% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 1/3</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Bellsprout pode evoluir para Weepinbell no nível 7 ou superior. Quando evolui, seus pontos de vida aumentam no dobro do seu nível.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Vine Whip</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>3</td><td>Growth</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>4</td><td>Wrap</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>5</td><td>Poison Powder, Sleep Powder</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>6</td><td>Stun Spore</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>8</td><td>Acid</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>9</td><td>Knock Off</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>10</td><td>Sweet Scent</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>12</td><td>Gastro Acid</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>13</td><td>Razor Leaf</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>14</td><td>Poison Jab</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>15</td><td>Slam, Wring Out</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>16</td><td>Power Whip</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>Acid Spray, Attract, Bind, Bullet Seed, Confide, Double Team, Encore, Endure, Energy Ball, Facade, Frustration, Gastro Acid, Giga Drain, Grass Knot, Grassy Glide, Grassy Terrain, Hidden Power, Infestation, Knock Off, Leaf Storm, Leech Life, Lunge, Magical Leaf, Nature Power, Poison Jab, Pounce, Protect, Reflect, Rest, Return, Round, Seed Bomb, Sleep Talk, Sludge Bomb, Sludge Wave, Snore, Solar Beam, Substitute, Sunny Day, Swagger, Swords Dance, Synthesis, Tera Blast, Thief, Toxic, Trailblaze, Venoshock, Weather Ball, Worry Seed</p><h3>Egg Moves</h3><p>Acid Spray, Belch, Bullet Seed, Clear Smog, Encore, Giga Drain, Ingrain, Leech Life, Magical Leaf, Natural Gift, Power Whip, Strength Sap, Sucker Punch, Synthesis, Tickle, Weather Ball, Worry Seed</p>",
